    "description": "The Ecommerce Cart Addition API facilitates the seamless addition of items to a customer's shopping cart in the eCommerce platform. By leveraging this API, developers can manage and enhance the user experience by efficiently updating shopping cart contents, allowing bulk additions in a single request. Typical consumers include eCommerce applications and shopping platforms aiming to improve their cart management functionalities. Use cases involve integrating this API into mobile and web applications to streamline the purchasing process.",
